dbox could not find `test/results/wave-nl0-v1/stage/case/library/M001-0001/work/sandbox.sb`. No successful probe report or evidence was obtained, so I cannot truthfully construct the required M source record or claim structural validation. The source failure is not evidence of a mathematical gap in the exercise.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"probe_library returned `accepted: false` and `Library probe failed: sandbox-exec: ... No such file or directory` for M001; read_mathlib located the candidate theorem and displayed its signature, which is not a substitute for the required probe evidence. The task requires source registration or an internal proof, and NL0 forbids treating analysis theorems as logical primitives. The exact approved target and proof-draft were read; no hypotheses were added.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"The target/hypotheses and all conventions were extracted unchanged: n,m positive integers; jointly smooth sphere-valued u on R^n×(0,∞); pointwise scalar-multiple normal acceleration; locally uniform-in-time compact support of u−q; Lebesgue measure, Euclidean norms, Frobenius gradient square, interior times only. The candidate proof’s key steps were reviewed: derivative vanishing outside C_J follows from constancy on the open spatial complement and continuity; e is continuous compactly supported and hence integrable; the common box B permits uniform difference-quotient convergence and differentiability; integration by parts gives E'=2∫u_t·(u_tt−Δu); differentiating |u|² and using the given normal-acceleration equation gives pointwise orthogonality and E'=0. No NL0 artifact was submitted because a complete source-backed graph could not be produced, and no successful artifact check was available.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Stop this stage honestly on a substantive or suspected proof gap, unavailable source, or input conflict. JSON fields: status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. Status must be SUBSTANTIVE_GAP, SUSPECTED_GAP, SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT. Difficulty alone is not a mathematical error.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"obstacle_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["obstacle_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"probe_library","description":"Query a proved Mathlib theorem and its exact signature/axioms in the offline sandbox. Returns located evidence for an M source; the mathematical statement and applicability still require review.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"declaration":{"type":"string"},"module":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","declaration","module"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false}],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":false,"prompt_cache_key":"ff096490-9d2a-41aa-b60c-117cb2e0f8b6","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"low"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"effort":"high","context":"all_turns","summary":null,"mode":"standard"},"user":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":22507,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":725,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":160},"total_tokens":23232,"attribution":{"items":{"fc_074ccd92e56090fa016adb1b500ecc8191901854e8fa6ad844":{"input_tokens":31,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_074ccd92e56090fa016adb1b52b5188191ab372f743d0c65b7":{"input_tokens":34,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_074ccd92e56090fa016adb1b55c130819183f4886abd83a391":{"input_tokens":34,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_074ccd92e56090fa016adb1b5d9404819183a949ce6b7b4673":{"input_tokens":33,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_074ccd92e56090fa016adb1b5fa3c4819193215bd2acced39d":{"input_tokens":35,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"outpu